{
  "book_id": "lantern",
  "title": "灯笼酒馆",
  "builtin": true,
  "schema": "worldbook.v1",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": 1,
      "title": "酒馆的位置（基础规则）",
      "keys": [],
      "secondary_keys": [],
      "selective_logic": "AND_ANY",
      "content": "灯笼酒馆只有一扇门，开在巷子尽头。屋里只有吧台、四张桌子和一盏总也不灭的灯笼。",
      "position": "system_head",
      "depth": 0,
      "order": 10,
      "weight": 100,
      "constant": true,
      "probability": 100,
      "sticky": 0,
      "cooldown": 0,
      "recursive": false,
      "case_sensitive": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "budget_chars_est": 38
    },
    {
      "uid": 2,
      "title": "灯笼（不灭的光）",
      "keys": [],
      "secondary_keys": [],
      "selective_logic": "AND_ANY",
      "content": "檐下那盏灯笼从不熄灭，光偏暖，照到的地方都像傍晚。外面天再黑，屋里始终有一点亮。",
      "position": "system_head",
      "depth": 0,
      "order": 20,
      "weight": 100,
      "constant": true,
      "probability": 100,
      "sticky": 0,
      "cooldown": 0,
      "recursive": false,
      "case_sensitive": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "budget_chars_est": 39
    },
    {
      "uid": 3,
      "title": "老板娘",
      "keys": [],
      "secondary_keys": [],
      "selective_logic": "AND_ANY",
      "content": "吧台后站着老板娘，系着围裙，说话慢，习惯替客人把杯沿擦干净。她记得每一个来过的人。",
      "position": "system_head",
      "depth": 0,
      "order": 30,
      "weight": 100,
      "constant": true,
      "probability": 100,
      "sticky": 0,
      "cooldown": 0,
      "recursive": false,
      "case_sensitive": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "budget_chars_est": 39
    },
    {
      "uid": 4,
      "title": "长夜酒（酒单）",
      "keys": [],
      "secondary_keys": [],
      "selective_logic": "AND_ANY",
      "content": "酒单只有一样：长夜酒。颜色深，入口暖，据说喝下去的人会愿意多坐一会儿。",
      "position": "system_head",
      "depth": 0,
      "order": 40,
      "weight": 100,
      "constant": true,
      "probability": 100,
      "sticky": 0,
      "cooldown": 0,
      "recursive": false,
      "case_sensitive": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "budget_chars_est": 35
    },
    {
      "uid": 5,
      "title": "夜的规矩",
      "keys": [],
      "secondary_keys": [],
      "selective_logic": "AND_ANY",
      "content": "这里不问来处，也不赶人走。你可以点一杯，坐着，什么都不说，她也不会催你。",
      "position": "system_head",
      "depth": 0,
      "order": 50,
      "weight": 100,
      "constant": true,
      "probability": 100,
      "sticky": 0,
      "cooldown": 0,
      "recursive": false,
      "case_sensitive": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "budget_chars_est": 34
    },
    {
      "uid": 11,
      "title": "吧台后的旧照片",
      "keys": ["照片", "旧照片"],
      "secondary_keys": ["吧台"],
      "selective_logic": "AND_ANY",
      "content": "吧台后面的墙上钉着一张褪了色的照片，边角卷起。照片里有两个人的影子和半截灯笼。",
      "position": "system_tail",
      "depth": 0,
      "order": 100,
      "weight": 100,
      "constant": false,
      "probability": 100,
      "sticky": 2,
      "cooldown": 0,
      "recursive": false,
      "case_sensitive": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "budget_chars_est": 37
    },
    {
      "uid": 12,
      "title": "长夜酒的滋味",
      "keys": ["长夜", "长夜酒"],
      "secondary_keys": ["酒", "一杯"],
      "selective_logic": "AND_ALL",
      "content": "长夜酒要先闻后喝。她说，急着下咽的人尝不出里面那点回甘，也记不住今晚。",
      "position": "system_tail",
      "depth": 0,
      "order": 110,
      "weight": 95,
      "constant": false,
      "probability": 100,
      "sticky": 0,
      "cooldown": 0,
      "recursive": false,
      "case_sensitive": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "budget_chars_est": 34
    },
    {
      "uid": 13,
      "title": "她的名字",
      "keys": ["名字", "叫什么"],
      "secondary_keys": ["已经", "早就"],
      "selective_logic": "NOT_ANY",
      "content": "她把杯子放下，笑了一下：名字不重要，重要的是你今晚还愿意坐在这里。",
      "position": "system_tail",
      "depth": 0,
      "order": 120,
      "weight": 90,
      "constant": false,
      "probability": 100,
      "sticky": 0,
      "cooldown": 0,
      "recursive": false,
      "case_sensitive": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "budget_chars_est": 31
    },
    {
      "uid": 14,
      "title": "窗外的巷子",
      "keys": ["窗外", "巷子", "门口"],
      "secondary_keys": ["雨", "风"],
      "selective_logic": "NOT_ALL",
      "content": "巷子很窄，石板被踩得发亮。偶尔有脚步声过去，又停住，最后没有推门。",
      "position": "history_depth",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 130,
      "weight": 85,
      "constant": false,
      "probability": 100,
      "sticky": 0,
      "cooldown": 2,
      "recursive": false,
      "case_sensitive": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "budget_chars_est": 32
    },
    {
      "uid": 15,
      "title": "檐下的灯影",
      "keys": ["灯笼", "灯影", "亮着"],
      "secondary_keys": [],
      "selective_logic": "AND_ANY",
      "content": "灯笼的光把她的影子投在墙上，影子会随着灯芯偶尔轻轻晃一下。",
      "position": "system_tail",
      "depth": 0,
      "order": 140,
      "weight": 80,
      "constant": false,
      "probability": 60,
      "sticky": 0,
      "cooldown": 2,
      "recursive": true,
      "case_sensitive": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "budget_chars_est": 29
    },
    {
      "uid": 16,
      "title": "照片里的人",
      "keys": ["照片", "影子"],
      "secondary_keys": ["两个人", "并肩"],
      "selective_logic": "AND_ANY",
      "content": "照片里是两个并着肩的影子，站在半截灯笼下面。脸看不清，衣角却是干净的，像刚拍不久。",
      "position": "system_tail",
      "depth": 0,
      "order": 150,
      "weight": 78,
      "constant": false,
      "probability": 100,
      "sticky": 1,
      "cooldown": 0,
      "recursive": false,
      "case_sensitive": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "budget_chars_est": 41
    },
    {
      "uid": 17,
      "title": "门的另一边",
      "keys": ["门外", "巷子尽头"],
      "secondary_keys": ["另一", "那边"],
      "selective_logic": "NOT_ALL",
      "content": "推开那扇门，外面永远是同一条巷子，石板湿着，路灯亮着。没有人说得清门那边通往哪里。",
      "position": "system_tail",
      "depth": 0,
      "order": 160,
      "weight": 76,
      "constant": false,
      "probability": 100,
      "sticky": 0,
      "cooldown": 0,
      "recursive": false,
      "case_sensitive": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "budget_chars_est": 41
    },
    {
      "uid": 18,
      "title": "酒里的回甘",
      "keys": ["回甘", "先闻"],
      "secondary_keys": ["急"],
      "selective_logic": "NOT_ANY",
      "content": "长夜酒要慢慢喝。急着下咽的人只尝到苦，等一会儿，才有一点回甘从舌根浮上来。",
      "position": "system_tail",
      "depth": 0,
      "order": 170,
      "weight": 74,
      "constant": false,
      "probability": 70,
      "sticky": 0,
      "cooldown": 0,
      "recursive": false,
      "case_sensitive": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "budget_chars_est": 37
    },
    {
      "uid": 19,
      "title": "灯笼为什么亮着",
      "keys": ["灯笼", "灯芯"],
      "secondary_keys": ["油", "不灭"],
      "selective_logic": "AND_ALL",
      "content": "灯笼靠一只旧灯芯撑着，油不多，却总也不灭。她说，只要还有人愿意进来坐坐，灯就有理由亮着。",
      "position": "system_tail",
      "depth": 0,
      "order": 180,
      "weight": 72,
      "constant": false,
      "probability": 100,
      "sticky": 0,
      "cooldown": 0,
      "recursive": false,
      "case_sensitive": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "budget_chars_est": 45
    },
    {
      "uid": 20,
      "title": "桌上的信",
      "keys": ["信", "字条"],
      "secondary_keys": ["客人", "桌"],
      "selective_logic": "AND_ANY",
      "content": "那封信没有封口，边角被雨打湿了一点。信上的字不多，落款处却被反复描过。",
      "position": "system_tail",
      "depth": 0,
      "order": 190,
      "weight": 70,
      "constant": false,
      "probability": 100,
      "sticky": 0,
      "cooldown": 0,
      "recursive": false,
      "case_sensitive": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "budget_chars_est": 36
    },
    {
      "uid": 21,
      "title": "雨夜的客人",
      "keys": ["客人", "来客"],
      "secondary_keys": ["雨", "湿"],
      "selective_logic": "NOT_ALL",
      "content": "雨夜来的客人放下伞，先在门口站一会儿，才往里走。他不多话，坐下先看那盏灯笼。",
      "position": "system_tail",
      "depth": 0,
      "order": 200,
      "weight": 68,
      "constant": false,
      "probability": 100,
      "sticky": 0,
      "cooldown": 3,
      "recursive": false,
      "case_sensitive": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "budget_chars_est": 39
    },
    {
      "uid": 22,
      "title": "天亮之前",
      "keys": ["天亮", "打烊"],
      "secondary_keys": [],
      "selective_logic": "AND_ANY",
      "content": "天快亮的时候，老板娘会把灯笼取下来吹熄。她说，屋里的灯可以灭，门却一直开着。",
      "position": "history_depth",
      "depth": 2,
      "order": 210,
      "weight": 66,
      "constant": false,
      "probability": 100,
      "sticky": 0,
      "cooldown": 0,
